# Godot 4 API

This is a Godot 4.x project (Engine 4.7). Use `await`, `@export`, `@onready`, `CharacterBody2D`/`CharacterBody3D`, the `velocity` property with `move_and_slide()` (no argument), and Callable-based signal connect syntax. Never use Godot 3 APIs (`KinematicBody2D`, `yield`, `move_and_slide(velocity)`, old `connect("signal", self, "method")`).
